  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now, tell your old father what you have been about!\"",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"Well, and my second son is setting up a grain market for himself and he is getting ready to go out with his friends and he is getting a new wife and he is buying a house and he is getting ready to marry and so he is busy and he is going to marry a poor woman, and he is getting his wife and he is getting ready to marry and he is getting a new wife and he is getting ready to marry and so he is busy and he is going to marry a poor woman,\"",
